    "group": "Inner Circle Task Force",
    "summary": "During your Command phase, you may vow to take one objective. The vowed objective designation clears when your next Command phase opens. A friendly DEATHWING INFANTRY unit adds +1 to wound rolls when its attack targets an enemy in range of that objective. Restrictions: DARK ANGELS units are permitted. ADEPTUS ASTARTES from another Chapter are excluded.",
